---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import fruitDisplay from '../assets/images/retail.jpg';
---

<section
  id="retail"
  class="bg-paper py-20 sm:py-28"
  aria-labelledby="retail-heading"
>
  <div class="wrap grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
    <div class="reveal order-2 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl lg:order-1">
      <Image
        src={fruitDisplay}
        alt="An arrangement of fresh fruits including citrus, grapes, pineapple and sliced produce"
        widths={[640, 960, 1280]}
        sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw"
        class="h-full min-h-[22rem] w-full object-cover"
        loading="lazy"
        quality={75}
      />
    </div>

    <div class="reveal order-1 lg:order-2">
      <p class="eyebrow">Retail</p>
      <h2 id="retail-heading" class="display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
        Fresh Produce for Everyday Needs
      </h2>
      <p class="lede mt-6">
        Alongside wholesale activity, MODH07 LIMITED is registered for the
        retail sale of fruit and vegetables in specialised stores. This reflects
        the company’s listed nature of business, covering both wholesale supply
        and retail sale of fresh produce.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
        Retail activity sits within the company’s UK registration for specialised
        fruit and vegetable sales. Details of any particular shop, hours or
        customer offering are not listed here.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
